forti-cli (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Documentation: the docs package (docs set forti-cli) is rewritten in
    Payload Markdown directives (TOCs, tabs, steps, callouts, cards, badges,
    buttons), with new summary tables for commands, exit statuses, plan states
    and rollback operations. The forti binary and the package contents are
    unchanged.

